tm_aqc.form.main.title=§lAquaculture Guidebook§r
tm_aqc.form.main.body=Begin your journey with Aquaculture by crafting a Fishing Rod with a Crafting Table to create an Angler's Crafting Table. This table will give you access to all of the Aquaculture crafting recipes and show you how to make them in the crafting menu.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~In order to catch Aquaculture fish, you'll need to craft an Iron Fishing Rod or better (Gold, Diamond, Netherite, or Neptunium.) Alternatively you can craft yourself a Fishing Spear or Harpoon and go underwater spear fishing!

