tm_aqc.form.fish_cataloge.title=Aquaculture Fish

tm_aqc.form.fish_cataloge.body=The Fish Catalogue is a special tracker that allows you to follow your fishing journey. It is accessed through the Aquaculture Guidebook's first page and shows every fish you have caught as well as information about that fish. This can help you find which Biome Groups they spawn in for future fishing adventures.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~A Fish Scanner can be crafted and used to identify a specific fish you see and view its fish catalogue page directly.
tm_aqc.form.contact.body=Aquaculture on Java by Shadowclaimer and Girafi~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Aquaculture on Bedrock by Shadowclaimer, Sauroops, and Tomhmagic~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§eWe would love to hear what you think of our Add-On!~LINEBREAK~§aIf you want to give feedback or request new features, please join the discord:~LINEBREAK~§9https://discord.gg/K8AsUGG7ZX
tm_aqc.form.angling.body=There are 59 new fish that inhabit the world you can catch with the new Aquaculture Fishing Rods. Each fish can only be caught in its own Biome Group which means they have their own habitats and you have to go out and fish the world!~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Aquaculture Fishing Rods can be made in Iron, Gold, Diamond, Netherite, or Neptunium. These rods can be modified at a Rod Modification Station and have a Hook or Bobber applied to them. Hooks enhance your ability to fish with special effects. Bobbers allow you to showcase a custom bobber in your favorite color so you can tell your bobber from your friend's.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Bait is obtained in various ways with the most common being sometimes fished up or gathered from a Worm Farm. While held in the offhand while you fish you get a special bonus while fishing based on the bait type.
tm_aqc.form.wild_fish.body=The 64 new underwater creatures that spawn underwater can be hunted using new fishing methods besides angling. By crafting a Fishing Spear or Harpoon you can go hunt fish in their natural environments.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Fishing Spears are special melee weapons that give extra resources when you strike down a fish in the wild. Harpoons are fired directly at fish to spear them, then you interact to pull them back to you.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Flippers allow you to swim faster, making it easier to catch tricky fish. The Snorkel increases your ability to breathe underwater.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Fish Sonar can be activated to scan for nearby fish and highlight them to make hunting them easier.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Rarely fish in the wild might be Monstrous Fish, these are much larger than the others and reward a special version of the fish when slain.
tm_aqc.form.biome_group.body=Each underwater creature can only spawn in certain conditions that mirror real world habitats. We use Biome Groups to determine how and where a fish will spawn. Some prefer wet conditions like Swamps, others dry like Desert, and a rare few require very specific biomes to spawn! Each individual biome will have a unique combination of fish based on its Biome Groups and traveling your world will help you see more varieties of fish!
tm_aqc.form.cutting_board.body=The Cutting Board allows you to prepare your fish or crustacean for cooking. By interacting with the bench while holding a fish or creature it slaps it down on the board. While holding a Fillet Knife you can interact again to fillet or process the creature which grants you a piece of meat which leaves bones or shell on the board. Another interact breaks the bones or shell which gives you Pin Bones or Shell Pieces.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Fillet Knives are crafted from Iron, Gold, Diamond, Netherite, or Neptunium and are used to interact with the Cutting Board.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Raw Fillets, Raw Shrimp, Raw Lobster, Raw Crayfish, and Raw Lobster can be cooked into cooked versions and eaten or used in various cooking recipes.
tm_aqc.form.stew_pot.body=The Stew Pot is a special cooking block that when placed on top of a campfire, you can make a series of new stews from your catches and other ingredients. It requires a liquid and three ingredients to make a stew. First add a bucket of liquid by interacting with the pot, and then add your three ingredients by interacting. Once your stew is done you can use a bowl to scoop out stew (up to three servings) or a bucket to scoop it all out at once. You can then eat your stew out of those bowls or buckets.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~There are eight unique stews.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Garbage Goulash - Created when any combination of liquid and ingredients doesn't make a stew recipe. It tastes awful.~LINEBREAK~Stone Soup - A cheap and effective stew made from Water, Cobblestone, Carrot, and Potato.~LINEBREAK~Fish Chowder - A warm stew made from Milk, Raw Fillet, Carrot, and Potato.~LINEBREAK~Clam Chowder - A thick and hearty stew made from Milk, Raw Clam, Carrot, and Potato.~LINEBREAK~Green Juice - A healthy drink made from Water and three Algae.~LINEBREAK~Gumbo - A thick and meaty stew made from Water, Raw Shrimp, Pork Chop, and Wheat.~LINEBREAK~Super Mushroom Stew - A tastier version of Mushroom Stew. Made from Water, Red Mushroom, Brown Mushroom, and Mushroom Stem.~LINEBREAK~Lobster Bisque - A very rich and creamy stew. Made from Milk, Raw Lobster, and two Carrots.~LINEBREAK~
tm_aqc.form.fish_mount.body="The Fish Mount is a new wall decoration that allows you to display your favorite catches. Interacting with it while holding a fish or crustacean will place it on the wall showing everyone your prowess as a fisher. Hitting it will return it to you.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~If you have weighed your fish on a Catchscale interacting once it is on the wall will also tell you information about its weight.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Monstrous creatures displayed in a Fish Mount have a special plaque and background."
tm_aqc.form.catchscale.body=The Catchscale is the ultimate test for anglers of all sorts. Weigh your catch to see who caught the biggest fish! Showcase your special catches on your walls and throw competitions so you can see who is the best fisher!~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~When you weigh a Monstrous Fish it can even surpass the maximum weight of its species!
tm_aqc.form.fishing_stool.body=The Fishing Stool is a convenient (and comfy) tool for fishing, place it down and a Chest adjacent and as you fish your catches will store immediately in the chest! Create your own comfy fishing spot in your corner of the world and enjoy your angling!
tm_aqc.form.fish_capturing.body=You can capture fish or underwater creatures using a Fishing Net or Fishing Pot.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Fishing Nets are placed underwater and after a set amount of time they will catch a fish based on the Biome Group. You can interact to collect your catch.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Fishing Pots operate the same way but only work for underwater creatures like shrimp instead of fish.
tm_aqc.form.worm_farm.body=A Worm Farm is an easy way to get worms. Like a Composter you can feed it organic materials to fill it you get some Worms for fishing bait. Some say there are rare Gold Worms that sometimes appear as well!
tm_aqc.form.aquatic_products.body="Fish can drop Scales or you can obtain them by filleting a fish at a Cutting Board. Scales are used for crafting Flippers, Spinner Baits, the Fish Scanner, Decorative Blocks, and more! You can also acquire Pin Bones in the same way, which are tiny bones used to make Bone Meal.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Shrimp, Lobsters, Crayfish, and Clams can drop Shell Pieces when processed at a cutting board. These Shell Pieces can be used to craft a variety of new decorative blocks.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Clams generate Pearls under certain conditions requiring an irritant to begin the process. When you feed them a Calcite block, Gold Block, or Obsidian they will create a Pearl after a period of time which can be used to craft a variety of new decoration options."
tm_aqc.form.neptunium.body="Neptunium is a rare treasure from fishing that can be used to upgrade your Diamond armor to be more aquatic.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Most Neptunium gear is crafted by placing four Neptunium Scales around a piece of Diamond equipment.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Neptunium Armor improves your underwater breathing and helps resist Mining Fatigue.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Neptunium Weapons have bonuses against underwater enemies.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Neptunium Tools work faster underwater.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Neptunium Fishing Rod is more alluring and catches fish faster.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Neptunium Fillet Knife grants bonuses when filleting fish.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Neptunium Fishing Spear and Neptunium Harpoon grant bonus loot when slaying fish."

tm_aqc.form.fish_cataloge.creative_mode=§cYou cannot open the Fish Catalogue in Creative Mode!§r


## Fish UI Info
tm_aqc:arapaima.info=Hi, I'm a §lArapaima§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 220lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Wet~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Beach~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm one of the biggest freshwater fish on Earth - over 10 feet long and super strong.
tm_aqc:atlantic_cod.info=Hi, I'm a §lAtlantic Cod§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 110lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I've fed generations with my flaky white meat and can live more than 25 years.
tm_aqc:atlantic_herring.info=Hi, I'm a §lAtlantic Herring§r, I can be as light as 0.1lb or as heavy as 2.4lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I love swimming in massive schools - millions of us moving as one!
tm_aqc:bayad.info=Hi, I'm a §lBayad§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 220lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm a sharp-toothed African predator who prowls rivers and lakes with stealth.
tm_aqc:sacramento_blackfish.info=Hi, I'm a §lSacramento Blackfish§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 28lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm a Californian native, cruising the still waters of swamps and ponds.
tm_aqc:bluegill.info=Hi, I'm a §lBluegill§r, I can be as light as 0.1lb or as heavy as 4.8lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm the fish kids love catching - round, scrappy, and fun-sized!
tm_aqc:nile_tilapia.info=Hi, I'm a §lNile Tilapia§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 13lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm tough as nails and can thrive in both fresh and salty waters.
tm_aqc:brown_shrooma.info=Hi, I'm a §lBrown Shrooma§r, I can be as light as 0.1lb or as heavy as 5.2lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Mooshroom~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun fact about me:~LINEBREAK~§rI'm a fictional creature made for this Add-On.§r~LINEBREAK~I'm a rare and colorful swimmer, said to appear only in fungus-filled lakes.
tm_aqc:brown_trout.info=Hi, I'm a §lBrown Trout§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 47lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm sneaky and hard to catch - I've mastered the art of staying hidden.
tm_aqc:nile_perch.info=Hi, I'm a §lNile Perch§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 440lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm a river giant who can reach 6 feet long and rule the waters.
tm_aqc:common_carp.info=Hi, I'm a §lCommon Carp§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 105lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm ancient, adaptable, and can live over two decades.
tm_aqc:blue_catfish.info=Hi, I'm a §lBlue Catfish§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 143lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm one of the biggest cats around - 100 pounds of whiskered power.
tm_aqc:florida_gar.info=Hi, I'm a §lFlorida Gar§r, I can be as light as 0.1lb or as heavy as 7lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I've got armor-like scales and can breathe air like it's no big deal.
tm_aqc:goldfish.info=Hi, I'm a §lGoldfish§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 67lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I might look simple, but I've got a memory that lasts for months!
tm_aqc:largemouth_bass.info=Hi, I'm a §lLargemouth Bass§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 22lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~Hook me and prepare for a fight - I don't give up easily.
tm_aqc:muskellunge.info=Hi, I'm a §lMuskellunge§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 70lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm the freshwater apex predator folks call “the fish of 10,000 casts.”
tm_aqc:yellow_perch.info=Hi, I'm a §lYellow Perch§r, I can be as light as 0.1lb or as heavy as 4.3lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm bright yellow with bold stripes and delicious on the plate.
tm_aqc:pink_salmon.info=Hi, I'm a §lPink Salmon§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 15lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I may be the smallest Pacific salmon, but I make the longest migrations upstream.
tm_aqc:black_pirahna.info=Hi, I'm a §lBlack Pirahna§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 12lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~My bite is no joke - I'm feared in South American rivers for a reason.
tm_aqc:american_pollock.info=Hi, I'm a §lAmerican Pollock§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 71lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm tasty and versatile, often showing up in fish sticks and sandwiches.
tm_aqc:rainbow_trout.info=Hi, I'm a §lRainbow Trout§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 48lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Hot~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I shimmer with colors and leap with energy in cool, fast streams.
tm_aqc:red_grouper.info=Hi, I'm a §lRed Grouper§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 51lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Cold~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I'm a heavyweight of the reef, lurking in the warm Gulf waters.
tm_aqc:red_shrooma.info=Hi, I'm a §lRed Shrooma§r, I can be as light as 0.1lb or as heavy as 5.2lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§aMUST BE§r: Mooshroom~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun fact about me:~LINEBREAK~§rI'm a fictional creature made for this Add-On.§r~LINEBREAK~I'm a mythical beauty from mushroomy depths, known for glowing red scales.
tm_aqc:smallmouth_bass.info=Hi, I'm a §lSmallmouth Bass§r, I can be as light as 1lb or as heavy as 12lb.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The Biome Groups you will find me in are:~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Dry~LINEBREAK~§l§cMUST NOT BE§r Ocean~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§lHere is a fun real-world fact about me:§r~LINEBREAK~I may be smaller than my cousin, but I'll give you a wild ride on the line.
